 "description": "<p>A sheer lace eye patch in two styles - 3039 and 3040 - offering slightly different shapes, in black and white. The lace sits gently over the eyes; the sheer factor means it obscures without blocking, which is the design intent.</p>\n<p>Two styles and two colors make four combinations, at a price that treats the choice as low-stakes. The soft lace edge is what separates this from the leather blackout versions.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Item type: eye patch</li>\n<li>Material: sheer lace</li>\n<li>Styles: 3039 and 3040, different shapes</li>\n<li>Color: black or white</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Pick style and color at order. The anticipation accessory - mystery at conversational distance, transparent up close.</p>\n",
 "short_description": "<p>Sheer lace eye patch in two styles and black or white, gentle fit, soft lace edge.</p>\n",
